1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,527
He ate a huge dinner.

2
00:00:01,567 --> 00:00:03,053
Now he's lying down!

3
00:00:03,233 --> 00:00:04,099
Lying down?

4
00:00:04,139 --> 00:00:05,787
Your acid will come up to me!

5
00:00:05,967 --> 00:00:07,610
Then three things happen.

6
00:00:07,650 --> 00:00:09,320
The third one burns!

7
00:00:09,500 --> 00:00:10,953
First, I'm too full.

8
00:00:11,133 --> 00:00:12,898
Second, my valve relaxes!

9
00:00:13,067 --> 00:00:15,353
Third, my acid flows up the food pipe!

10
00:00:15,533 --> 00:00:16,526
Ow! It burns!

11
00:00:16,566 --> 00:00:17,530
Make it stop!

12
00:00:19,367 --> 00:00:21,053
Ow! My chest is on fire!

13
00:00:21,500 --> 00:00:23,987
Doctor, why does my
chest burn after dinner?

14
00:00:24,167 --> 00:00:27,953
That's heartburn: stomach acid
travelling up toward your throat.

15
00:00:28,133 --> 00:00:31,344
But here's the twist:
the problem is a door.

16
00:00:31,384 --> 00:00:33,987
Your stomach's valve
relaxes when it shouldn't.

17
00:00:34,167 --> 00:00:36,025
And lying down makes it worse?

18
00:00:36,200 --> 00:00:39,358
Yes. So no food for three
or four hours before bed.

19
00:00:39,533 --> 00:00:42,620
And raise the head of your
bed ten to twenty centimetres.

20
00:00:43,067 --> 00:00:45,157
Ahh. Nothing is coming up tonight!

21
00:00:45,333 --> 00:00:47,673
A huge dinner, four hours ago.

22
00:00:47,713 --> 00:00:49,253
Now he can lie down!
